{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1488136-hunter-the-reconing-5th-edition","id":1488136,"title":"Hunter the Reconing 5th Edition","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-26T23:56:47-07:00","id":1488136,"title":"Hunter the Reconing 5th Edition","content":"So, what is your take on the new version of Hunters in the 5th Edition WoD?<br /> <br /> Top, Flop, okay-ish or Wishing for a HtR 20th Anniversary book?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-27T00:14:23-07:00","id":1488138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>heinrich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1488136-hunter-the-reconing-5th-edition#post1488136\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, what is your take on the new version of Hunters in the 5th Edition WoD?<br /> <br /> Top, Flop, okay-ish or Wishing for a HtR 20th Anniversary book?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Looks more like hunter the vigil lite than reckoning, nothing special but better than V5 at least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27142,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","user":"Newb95","date":". 08-02-2022, 09:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-27T01:14:11-07:00","id":1488142,"title":"","content":"I now had time to browse over the book myself and yes, it is Hunter the Vigil ported to the classic WoD.<br /> <br /> The Imbued and Messengers aren't even mentioned. Were they now retconned out of existence?<br /> The capital-H Hunters are said to have Creed, Drives and Edges that separates them from lowercase-h hunters, like members of the Society of St. Leopold, FBI or what not. But then the Edges are basically fancy bonuses to things that should be Backgrounds - and an Edge is basically that a Hunter character has access to this on her own, while a hunter character would have access to this through he organisation he works for/with.<br /> <br /> They have a nice little mechanic to get extra dice, but if one of them shows a '1' the player has to decide to either have the role fail and get a 'Despair' condition that has to be resolved by role-played events, or to succeed in the roll (shortterm) but have a longterm setback represented in an increase in &quot;Danger&quot; for the current &quot;Hunt&quot;.<br /> <br /> All in all the Hunters are normal humans and the supernaturals have about half a dozend moster qualitites but no clear ties to VtM or the upcoming WtA 5th edition.<br /> <br /> All in all, what this book tries to go for is probably already accomplished in d20 modern, spycraft or .... well... Hunter: The Vigil.<br /> <br /> It was nice that they incorporated Orpheus, though. Most people forget that it is a cWoD game aswell...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-27T01:40:17-07:00","id":1488144,"title":"","content":"Its difficult to discern who it's made for.<br /> <br /> -its lacks the diversity and depth of vigil.<br /> <br /> -it doesn't link with the origional reckoning.<br /> <br /> -urban monster hunter games are a dime a dozen.<br /> <br /> It really doesn't bring anything to the table I'm forced to asked &quot;who is this for?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 07-27-2022, 04:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-27T03:20:47-07:00","id":1488152,"title":"","content":"Essentially, it's written for people that have only played D&amp;D 5e, and this is their first gateway into the wider world of RPGs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[